### List seed courses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses

### Create: 201 plus Location
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":100,"code":"SE411","name":"Software Construction","description":"Spring CRUD lab","credits":3}

### Read: 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/100

### Update: 204
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/100
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":100,"code":"SE411","name":"Software Construction Updated","description":"Updated description","credits":4}

### Delete: 204
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/100

### Deleted course: 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses/100

### Invalid body: 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":-1,"code":"","name":"A","credits":11}

### Existing ID: 422
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":1,"code":"SE411","name":"Duplicate ID","credits":3}
